OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CPubs want help from government and     
OL,5,Ccustomers                              
OL,6,GPubs are calling for more government   
OL,7,Gsupport and for customers to use them  
OL,8,Gmore, as many struggle to stay afloat. 
OL,10,FAmong measures being asked for is a    
OL,11,Flower rate of VAT for pubs as they     
OL,12,Fbattle with high energy costs.         
OL,14,FOne village pub landlord in Probus,    
OL,15,FCornwall, said: "The government like   
OL,16,Fto think they're listening to us and   
OL,17,Fhave introduced things like business   
OL,18,Frate relief but that doesn't even      
OL,19,Fscratch the surface." Another in       
OL,20,FCamborne said it would have to "close  
OL,21,Fthe doors for good" without more       
OL,22,Fsupport from local people.        G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
