OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CPrison fire systems not upgraded       
OL,5,Cdespite mum's death                    
OL,6,GA woman whose mother died in a prison  
OL,7,Gcell fire says her family "can't get   
OL,8,Gclosure" because the safety concerns   
OL,9,Glinked to her death remain unresolved  
OL,10,Gfour years later.                      
OL,12,FAn inquest into the death of Clare     
OL,13,FDupree at HMP Eastwood Park found      
OL,14,Fdelays in detecting the fire           
OL,15,Fcontributed to her death. Despite      
OL,16,Fenforcement notices from fire safety   
OL,17,Finspectors, there is still no          
OL,18,Fautomatic fire detection (AFD) in      
OL,19,Fcells at the prison, the BBC has found.
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
