OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,C'Abusive' drivers targeting road       
OL,5,Cworkers amid closures                  
OL,6,GAbuse from drivers towards road        
OL,7,Gworkers, including some targeting      
OL,8,Gthose on site with their vehicles, has 
OL,9,Gled to a new council campaign.         
OL,11,FTia Reynolds from Somerset, an         
OL,12,Fapprentice with contractor Kier, said  
OL,13,Fshe frequently sees people ignore road 
OL,14,Fclosures and shout verbal abuse, and   
OL,15,Fhas even seen drivers using their      
OL,16,Fvehicles as weapons.                   
OL,18,FShe has called on motorists to be more 
OL,19,Fconsiderate as Somerset Council        
OL,20,Flaunched a campaign to improve the     
OL,21,Fsafety of people working on the        
OL,22,Fcouncil's roads.                  G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
