OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CFlu and discharge waits cause hospital 
OL,5,Cbed shortage                           
OL,6,GMore patients are waiting in emergency 
OL,7,Gdepartments without a bed due to       
OL,8,Grising flu cases and delays to         
OL,9,Gdischarges, NHS bosses have said.      
OL,11,FGloucestershire Hospitals NHS          
OL,12,FFoundation Trust said last week about  
OL,13,F150 patients were medically fit to     
OL,14,Fleave its hospitals but remained on    
OL,15,Fwards, while about 60 beds were taken  
OL,16,Fup by flu patients.                    
OL,18,FEmergency department staff are having  
OL,19,Fto care for patients in corridors at   
OL,20,Fpeak times as about 30 people a day    
OL,21,Fare waiting for a bed, the trust added.
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
